DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T183000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260926T200000
SUMMARY:🍽 al di là Trattoria
LOCATION:al di là Trattoria\, 248 5th Ave\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215
DESCRIPTION:The Park Slope institution since 1998: candlelit Venetian home cooking at fair prices\, a 20-minute stroll up 5th Ave from Yulia's door.\nHours: Dinner nightly ~5:30–10\; lunch/brunch some days (check)\nPrice: $$ (~$65pp)\nhttps://www.aldilatrattoria.com\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
