BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-2026-tatyana-d1-0-pmiriam@nyc
DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T114500
SUMMARY:🍽 Miriam
LOCATION:Miriam\, 79 5th Ave\, Brooklyn\, NY 11217
DESCRIPTION:Park Slope's favourite brunch — shakshuka\, Israeli breakfast platters\, halva French toast — a sunny start before the Brooklyn Museum or Botanic Garden.\nHours: Daily ~9am–10pm\; brunch menu until 4\nPrice: $$ (brunch ~$30\, dinner ~$50)\nhttps://www.miriamrestaurant.com\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-2026-tatyana-d1-1-pprospectpark@nyc
DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T122500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T135500
SUMMARY:🌳 Prospect Park
LOCATION:Prospect Park\, Prospect Park West at 15th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215
DESCRIPTION:Olmsted and Vaux built Central Park first\, then came here and did it better. The Long Meadow is a mile of unbroken grass five minutes from the front door.\nHours: Daily 5am–1am\nPrice: free\nhttps://www.prospectpark.org/\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
