DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T153000
SUMMARY:🏠 Home for a rest — tea\, feet up\, change for the evening
LOCATION:
DESCRIPTION:\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-2026-tatyana-d1-3-pbrooklynheightspromenade@nyc
DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T170500
SUMMARY:🗽 Brooklyn Heights Promenade
LOCATION:Brooklyn Heights Promenade\, Brooklyn Heights Promenade\, Montague St & Pierrepont Pl\, Brooklyn\, NY 11201
DESCRIPTION:A third of a mile of benches cantilevered over the BQE with the whole Lower Manhattan skyline\, the Statue and the bridge laid out in front — the classic Brooklyn sunset\, backed by the brownstone streets (Willow\, Columbia Heights) of the city's first suburb.\nHours: Daily ~dawn–1am\nPrice: free\nhttps://www.nycgovparks.org/\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-2026-tatyana-d1-4-pbrooklynbridgepark@nyc
DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T171500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260927T181000
SUMMARY:🌳 Brooklyn Bridge Park (Pier 1\, Jane's Carousel\, Pebble Beach)
LOCATION:Brooklyn Bridge Park (Pier 1\, Jane's Carousel\, Pebble Beach)\, Pier 1\, 334 Furman St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11201
DESCRIPTION:1.3 miles of reclaimed piers under the Brooklyn Bridge with the best straight-on skyline view in the city\; the 1922 carousel in its glass pavilion\, Pebble Beach between the bridges and lawns for a sunset picnic.\nHours: Daily 6am–1am\; Jane's Carousel $3/ride (fall: typically 11am–5:50pm\, closed some weekdays — confirm)\nPrice: free\; carousel $3\nhttps://www.brooklynbridgepark.org/\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
