DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261002T172000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261002T182000
SUMMARY:🍽 Sofreh
LOCATION:Sofreh\, 75 St Marks Ave\, Brooklyn\, NY 11217
DESCRIPTION:Nasim Alikhani's celebrated Persian dining room — saffron tahdig\, herb stews\, rosewater desserts — flavours Tatyana will half-recognise from the Caucasus\, in a beautiful room.\nHours: Dinner Tue–Sun ~5:30–10\nPrice: $$$ (~$80pp)\nhttps://www.sofrehnyc.com\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
