BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-2026-tatyana-d7-0-pdevocion@nyc
DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T111000
SUMMARY:☕ Devoción (Williamsburg)
LOCATION:Devoción (Williamsburg)\, 69 Grand St (btwn Wythe & Kent Ave)\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:A skylit warehouse full of plants and leather sofas serving coffee flown fresh from Colombia within days of harvest — the most beautiful café in Williamsburg and a proper sit-down break.\nHours: Daily ~7am–7pm\nPrice: coffee $5–7\nhttps://www.devocion.com\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-2026-tatyana-d7-1-pbedfordavenue@nyc
DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T112000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T124500
SUMMARY:🛍 Bedford Avenue & North Williamsburg
LOCATION:Bedford Avenue & North Williamsburg\, Bedford Ave between N 3rd St and N 10th St (with N 6th St & Wythe Ave)\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:Brooklyn's main street for style: Catbird's tiny jewelry shop\, Mociun\, Awoke Vintage\, Buffalo Exchange\, Aesop and Le Labo\, and now Hermès/Chanel-level pop-ups around N 6th & Wythe — mixed with the best cafés and Domino Park on the waterfront.\nHours: Shops ~11am/12–7/8pm daily\nPrice: $$–$$$ (Catbird rings from ~$50\; vintage $20–150)\nhttps://www.northbrooklynchamber.org/\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-2026-tatyana-d7-2-psmorgasburgwilliamsburg@nyc
DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T125500
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T140000
SUMMARY:🍽 Smorgasburg Williamsburg
LOCATION:Smorgasburg Williamsburg\, Marsha P. Johnson State Park\, 90 Kent Ave\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:The original Saturday waterfront edition with the Manhattan skyline behind the stalls — pairs with Bedford Ave shopping\, Artists & Fleas and Domino Park\; Sat Oct 3 is Tatyana's last full day.\nHours: Saturdays 11–6\, April–late October (2026 season end date: confirm)\nPrice: $ (~$15–25pp)\nhttps://www.smorgasburg.com\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-2026-tatyana-d7-3-pdominopark@nyc
DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T141400
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T144400
SUMMARY:🌳 Domino Park
LOCATION:Domino Park\, 300 Kent Ave\, Brooklyn\, NY 11249
DESCRIPTION:Built on the bones of the Domino Sugar refinery: salvaged cranes and syrup tanks left standing over a strip of waterfront with the best head-on Manhattan view in Williamsburg.\nHours: Daily 6am–1am\nPrice: free\nhttps://www.dominopark.com/\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
