DTSTAMP:20260922T053139Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T215500
SUMMARY:🍸 Weather Up (Prospect Heights)
LOCATION:Weather Up (Prospect Heights)\, 589 Vanderbilt Ave (at Bergen St)\, Brooklyn\, NY 11238
DESCRIPTION:Dark\, subway-tiled\, no sign\, with a lovely back garden — the Prospect Heights bar that has been quietly excellent since 2008\, 10 minutes from the Brooklyn Museum.\nHours: Daily ~5:30pm–2am\nPrice: cocktails $15–18\nhttps://www.weatherupnyc.com/\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
