SUMMARY:☕ Winner
LOCATION:Winner\, 367 7th Ave (at 11th St)\, Brooklyn\, NY 11215
DESCRIPTION:Daniel Eddy's beloved bakery five blocks from the apartment — sourdough\, morning buns\, ham-and-cheese croissants and rotisserie chicken — the natural 'home' breakfast spot\; Runner Up wine bar is next door.\nHours: Daily ~7am–5pm (bakery/café)\; rotisserie and dinner-to-go later — confirm\nPrice: coffee $4–6\, pastries $5–7\, sandwiches $12–16\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
