DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261004T132200
SUMMARY:🌳 Green-Wood Cemetery
LOCATION:Green-Wood Cemetery\, 500 25th St\, Brooklyn\, NY 11232
DESCRIPTION:478 acres of hills\, ponds and Victorian monuments\, with wild parrots nesting in the Gothic gate. From Battle Hill\, the highest point in Brooklyn\, you can see the whole harbour.\nHours: Daily 8am–6pm (gates close promptly)\nPrice: free to walk in\nhttps://www.green-wood.com/\nhttps://mdunlap15.github.io/cousinnyctrip/
END:VEVENT
